Z||000007||DXR_DAD||09-09-2001||06:56 PM||||Boom!!! Those are my intakes <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I didn't put you together with a forum member?? Sorry but your install in just as it should be. That is a before recall tube. I do have some after recall tubes with the breather connection. I have sold quite a few of these on ebay, I think you are the first forum member to have one? All customer were just as happy as you <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. I had one on my car for over a year before I started to sell them!!<P>I have one on ebay now: <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=595205191" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=595205191</A> <P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=11225628&p=42141036&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=12120996&p=52431358&Sequence=0&res=high"> <BR>This is the after recall tube<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=12120996&p=49125659&Sequence=0&res=high"> <BR>My new set up...It's been on about 7 months now!<P>Boom Thanks, I'm glad you like it<P>DXR_DAD aka toykar1 on ebay<P>||||reg||14
Z||000008||DXR_DAD||09-09-2001||07:07 PM||||Jaei Sun,  The water thing is just a meth?<BR>Like I said I had this set up over a year most of the Golden Gate Fiero members know this. They will also tell you the "Little Black Toy" is never ill!!! It runs! <BR>The mouth of the cone is right at the opening in the wheel well that goes to the side scoop. I'm sure thats how Boom has his.<P>DXR_DAD||||reg||1
