Z||000010||Boomtastic||09-09-2001||08:05 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DXR_DAD:<BR><B>Boom!!! Those are my intakes  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>NO WAY! Too strange!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Well, I do love it, and have received a LOT of comments (all good) about it. As you stated, the air filter sits directly over the mouth of the water separator's outlet (the bottom of the OEM air cleaner box). It sounds GREAT, and looks better!<P>Well, if anyone else has any "problems" like I did, send them my way and I'll either make them an air pipe or tell them how to do it.<P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif"> ||||reg||1
