Z||000025||MooCow||09-10-2001||06:50 PM||||I had this on my car for a while then made it back to stock.  I can say that it didn't suck hot air in for me when I had it on.  Made a great sound.  The only reason I changed it back was because it kept my engine running cold all the time and would idle at 1,500 all the time.  Since I changed it back the idle is now back to 1,000 and it gets a lot more hotter.  I do miss it though, but have to wait till I can get someone to re time it once I install it again.  I had Craig's way not DXR_DAD.  Even though both look nearly the same way.<P>Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_7.jpg"> <BR>87 GT, 3.4 engine with a 4:10 tranny, and Viper Yellow!||||reg||1
